{"generated": "2026-08-19 08:33", "curation": {"market": "<b>미국 국채금리 급등과 고금리 충격</b>\n미국 30년물 국채금리가 5.3%까지 치솟으며 2007년 이후 최고치를 기록하는 등 글로벌 채권금리가 급등했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5hSEVWNEd4YWpmSFpQcm5DNUZacWpvRXpfWUpYTW5qeHZzMGwwcV9ZYU80MTRzbWNza25TM20xQTM3dERISzhTSnZGN01YMTNEcmN2RkpoZ2JwSjFmbV93U2hjUHJHSmRGTm5Ma2lnTlRndw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#7</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBWaTF4emVlOWltdmYxNnZwNlB5aDliZ3AtZ3MyQmRJNnZ0S2NBNVJYVWNiMXE4dE5aMnllcVFCOWpxcTJlQmxlZ1RoRFVQLU1BYTRYX3cwOEM?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#23</a>]. 이로 인해 뉴욕증시는 사흘 연속 하락했으며, 나스닥 지수가 1.33% 밀리는 등 투자 심리가 크게 위축되었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE5weUVmVUFOYjlaVFBNQjVMQU55RlY1bW16cUJFbzVNM2tMeTdOTlJhOEhRMVZkcTRqd1NhbkxZWUJQbF90bWNIZmJqdVB0OGs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#1</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9mbms3dDdFR3JuSThJVzA5elVyNXBKSUdoMzZTdHNWamdwTUEzUHhkbVFqODFfR2lQS3Z1MmdwMEJfeHBUeTFEUzFpUjN3SEdwWXUxelRFTVBTdUVJOTZfbnlsc05QWU5OT29aUE5lc0o?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#4</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFA2RmdoY2RXRUgxRVJjeFFNRndtOC1GMDMwaTBjSEJNdl90QXlYSlM4Y2VJMUFqMXZGTjRvR0paYnBVWHFZa2dIN3Jjb1JJdTQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a>].\n\n<b>중동 지정학적 불안과 유가 상승</b>\n미국과 이란의 갈등을 비롯한 중동 지역의 긴장감이 지속되면서 국제유가가 동반 상승했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE42cVpIaTNGYzR2bmFiT1J6aW9hMlFibVZqcXM3X2tDa2pNRXlGbFhHaEdEQ0J5bEY0c0tNc25ab1gwX05aSHh0ZHFSUmdfTG8?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTFBpX3psQjN1X3ZMOEliUDZsQ0JldzNVdk1DQ3JKeDliaVFvbVFrdm1kejZNSXA0QkJUcnF0WHFkMlh1WU5RRE5SemI1eUZuZDczZWNOalJxYkl4QdIBVEFVX3lxTFBpSWU1TXBkR3FycTluNnlDYmlzSm8wQjNxWW11Wm9naFViRV9IUy1tb0NUbjFCeGljdG5SOGxyaXI3TnQwbTZ4NjlDd0YtYlNfLTJMRA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=